        model: 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001',
        max_tokens: 10,
        system: 'You detect if a message is about: sales alerts/notifications, weekly/monthly reports, adding a new product to sell, showing registered products, deleting a product, deleting the whole business, asking about AI intelligence/learning insights, POS system, inventory/stock management, invoices, point-of-sale settings, linking/registering a Meta ad ID to a product/offer, or asking about/managing Meta ad performance, campaigns, ad sets, budgets, or ad strategy. Reply ONLY with YES or NO.',
